        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 77204439-76fd-4ec8-a3cb-6c3870cc0397).Image",
        "Description": "`The Tides Below`\r\rThe Orpheus League has infiltrated Haven Island. The resident doctor has been recruited by The Moirai Division to find more &#39;volunteers&#39; to donate organs for the rich. The personal trainer finds the fittest specimens. We&#39;ve also discovered that this tropical resort is the place where the people who changed their appearance get their brand new identity. \r\rEliminate the doctor, the assistant and the PT.  Find the server farm and eliminate the operatives responsible for creating the new identities.\r\r",
